## Arithmetic Hodge Completion Conjecture

对每个 observer ordinate \(t\)，构造一列有限 Hilbert complexes：

$$
\cdots
\longrightarrow
\mathcal C_{M,t}^{k-1}
\overset{d_{M,t}^{k-1}}{\longrightarrow}
\mathcal C_{M,t}^{k}
\overset{d_{M,t}^{k}}{\longrightarrow}
\mathcal C_{M,t}^{k+1}
\longrightarrow\cdots,
$$

